OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost places
OL,6,Fstay dry overnight but clear periods
OL,7,Fin the evening will decrease as
OL,8,Fthickening cloud spreads southeast.
OL,9,FThis brings patchy light rain to the
OL,10,Fwest towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSome patchy light rain in
OL,13,Ffar west at first, otherwise most
OL,14,Fstaying dry by day with some limited
OL,15,Fbrighter spells appearing. Cloudy and
OL,16,Flight rain spread southeast for the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
