OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright with sunny spells Sunday and
OL,7,FMonday. Patchy light rain in the east
OL,8,Fbut dry west Tuesday. The chance of
OL,9,Ffog Monday morning.
